    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44945" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὑρησί̆-λογος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ingenious in argument,
				sophistical</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				31
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				4.37
			</span></i>. —<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὑρησι</span>- is
			freq. in Pap. in this group of words, e.g. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRein.</u>
				14.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15.21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.207
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὑρεσι</span>- first in
			Pap. of <span class="entity">iv A.D.</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				71 i 9
			</span></i> (corr. fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὑρησι</span>-), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMasp.</u>
				153.32
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>, etc., f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				18.46.3
			</span></i>, Ph.ll.cc. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὑρης</span>-
				v.l.
			<i><span class="en">
				1.628
			</span></i>), etc.</div>
